      <li><span class="pos">2</span>{{ stage('ready', 18) }}<a class="lt" href="/tasks/CG-222">The evaluation corpus for routing</a><span class="why"><span class="id">CG-222</span> · priority 3 · work · medium → <span class="skip">phase frozen</span></span></li>
