      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-245">CG-245</a><span>Isolate planner execution from operator state</span><span class="fact">rebased, waiting for its rollup · CI pending</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-251">CG-251</a><span>Cost per accepted task and first-pass approval per model, tier and harness</span><span class="fact held">held: the automated review verdict is request_changes, not approve</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-244">CG-244</a><span>Reserve retro task IDs and survive duplicate records</span><span class="fact">round 1 of 4 · CI success · only 1 review round so far, need 2</span></li>
    </ul></div></div>
  <div class="g"><h4>reviews waiting: one line per gate the scheduler applies, in its order</h4>
    <div class="sub"><h3>Reviews waiting</h3><ul>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-242">CG-242</a><span>review · Hold untrusted config changes before live reload</span><span class="fact">dispatch paused: reviews start again with dispatch</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-242">CG-242</a><span>review · Hold untrusted config changes before live reload</span><span class="fact">its revise record has no process; the tick that reaps it starts the review</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-250">CG-250</a><span>review · A reopen verdict is a working process</span><span class="fact">waits for its revise run to finish</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-244">CG-244</a><span>persona:security · Reserve retro task IDs</span><span class="fact">claude harness paused</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-245">CG-245</a><span>review · Isolate planner execution from operator state</span><span class="fact">no review slot (3 of 3 busy)</span></li>
      <li><a class="id" href="/tasks/CG-236">CG-236</a><span>review · A trial winner's PR enters the review queue</span><span class="fact">queued: the next tick starts it</span></li>
